     "claim": "A spark sets off a tiny blast of fuel and air on top of a piston.",
     "role": "how",
     "search": "spark plug ignites fuel air mixture above piston"
    },
    {
     "claim": "The blast shoves the piston down, and the rod spins the crankshaft.",
     "role": "fix2",
     "search": "piston connecting rod crankshaft how car engine works"
